---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Privacy | Huuhka.net" description="Analytics choices and third-party services on Pasi Huuhka's blog.">
  <main id="main" class="privacy-page page-width">
    <h1>Privacy</h1>
    <p>This blog is run by Pasi Huuhka. You can read the articles without accepting analytics or loading comments.</p>
    <h2>Google Analytics</h2>
    <p>If you accept analytics, this site loads Google Analytics to measure visits, popular pages,
      and traffic sources. Google receives information about your visit and device and uses
      analytics cookies to distinguish visitors and sessions. Advertising storage,
      advertising personalization, and Google signals are disabled in this site's configuration.</p>
    <p>Analytics stays off until you accept. Use Privacy settings in the footer to reject analytics
      later. Rejection stops this site's collection and removes its accessible Google Analytics cookies.
      It does not delete data already received by Google.</p>
    <p>Your choice is stored in this browser for up to 180 days. Analytics cookies are configured
      with a 180-day lifetime that can renew on visits. Clearing browser storage resets your choice.
      The Google Analytics account controls retention of the data it receives.</p>
    <p>See <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy">Google's privacy policy</a>
      and <a href="https://policies.google.com/technologies/partner-sites">how Google uses data from partner sites</a>.</p>
    <h2>Comments</h2>
    <p>Comments use giscus and public GitHub Discussions. The comment service only loads after
      you choose Show comments. Loading it connects your browser to giscus and GitHub.
      Commenting requires GitHub sign-in, and comments are public. Loading comments
      does not enable Google Analytics.</p>
    <p>See the <a href="https://github.com/giscus/giscus/blob/main/PRIVACY-POLICY.md">giscus privacy policy</a>
      and <a href="https://docs.github.com/en/site-policy/privacy-policies/github-general-privacy-statement">GitHub's privacy statement</a>.</p>
    <h2>Hosting and embedded content</h2>
    <p>Azure hosts the site and its images. Hosting providers receive network information needed
      to serve requests. Some older articles include external media, such as videos. Those services
      have their own privacy practices; the analytics setting does not control those embeds.</p>
    <h2>Questions or removal requests</h2>
    <p>Contact <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/pasihuuhka/">Pasi on LinkedIn</a>
      with privacy questions or requests concerning comments.</p>
  </main>
</Base>
<style>
  .privacy-page { max-width: 720px; padding-block: 40px; }
  h1 { font-size: 32px; margin-bottom: 24px; }
  h2 { font-size: 24px; margin-block: 32px 12px; }
  p { margin-block: 16px; }
  a { color: var(--link); text-decoration: underline; }
</style>
